  "Plan to transplant {crop} in {entry}. Start checking seedlings in {start}; if they are still not ready by {latest}, update the plan instead of treating the bed as occupied.": "Cwangcisa ukutshintshela {crop} ngo-{entry}. Qala ujonge izithole ngo-{start}; ukuba azikalungi ngo-{latest}, hlaziya isicwangciso kunokuba uthathe umbhede njengothathiweyo.",
