  "Twelve dots = Jan to Dec. Green marks the months you can sow that crop in this site's rainfall pattern.": "Amachaphaza alishumi elinesibini = Jan ukuya Dis. Okuluhlaza kuphawula iinyanga onokuhlwayela kuzo eso sityalo kwipatheni yemvula yale ndawo.",
  "Space-hungry — wants its own bed": "Sifuna indawo enkulu — sifuna umbhede walo",
